msgid "Select the matching ADDSRAM/TCM/CCM/SRAM1/SRAM4 macro; there is no implicit fallback region. Startup/linker tests and the linked ELF establish copy/zero spans, alignment, garbage collection and budgets. NOINIT alone promises no reset or power-loss retention. Treat TCM/CCM placement as CPU-only unless the exact SoC contract authorizes the selected bus master's access. Placement alone never grants DMA reachability, cache coherence, alignment or borrowing permission. The default main stack and ordinary storage layout remain unchanged."
