msgid "Exact silicon admission"
msgstr "Exact silicon admission"

msgid "Optional cold `nx_silicon_preflight` reads the selected source once, after the caller establishes legal privilege, MMIO and security state, before acquiring I/O resources. It never enables clocks or repairs hardware. Keep the policy, strictly ordered exact revision rules and their review-source SHA256 together; the digest identifies review input and is not authentication or a claim that workarounds were applied. The build supplies its reviewed applied-workaround mask. Numerical revision zero is valid when explicitly observed."
msgstr "Optional cold `nx_silicon_preflight` reads the selected source once, after the caller establishes legal privilege, MMIO and security state, before acquiring I/O resources. It never enables clocks or repairs hardware. Keep the policy, strictly ordered exact revision rules and their review-source SHA256 together; the digest identifies review input and is not authentication or a claim that workarounds were applied. The build supplies its reviewed applied-workaround mask. Numerical revision zero is valid when explicitly observed."

msgid "`allow_unreviewed` cannot bypass a blocked revision, missing observation, group/density mismatch or missing workaround. A completed rejection copies its diagnostic reason without authorizing startup; source failure leaves output unchanged. A device group and density do not establish package, PCB or physical qualification. `silicon_admission_test.cpp` tests these distinctions against the real preflight implementation and an explicit mocked identity source."
msgstr "`allow_unreviewed` cannot bypass a blocked revision, missing observation, group/density mismatch or missing workaround. A completed rejection copies its diagnostic reason without authorizing startup; source failure leaves output unchanged. A device group and density do not establish package, PCB or physical qualification. `silicon_admission_test.cpp` tests these distinctions against the real preflight implementation and an explicit mocked identity source."

