#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/arch/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Public headers remain in `include/nexus/arch/`. Arm Cortex-M implementation "
"sources live in `arm/cortex_m/`, and host primitives live in `native/`. The "
