#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:20
msgid ""
"Every selected instance has a readonly face containing shared readonly "
"methods and an independent private context. On a 32-bit target the face "
"occupies eight bytes of readonly storage; method tables, mutable state, "
"selected buffers and linked code have separate costs. Generated instances "
"use exact static storage; explicit constructors use storage provided by "
"their owner. Public consumers receive no vendor register layout or SDK state"
" type."
msgstr ""
"Every selected instance has a readonly face containing shared readonly "
"methods and an independent private context. On a 32-bit target the face "
"occupies eight bytes of readonly storage; method tables, mutable state, "
"selected buffers and linked code have separate costs. Generated instances "
"use exact static storage; explicit constructors use storage provided by "
"their owner. Public consumers receive no vendor register layout or SDK state"
" type."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:27
msgid ""
"Public operations validate the face and dispatch `ops(context, ...)`. "
"Providers can use direct private calls within their register hot paths. A "
"missing optional method reports `NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`. Different "
"provider/mode tables coexist without replacing public symbols. IRQ entries "
"are fixed to the selected concrete instances and do not look up a factory "
"for each byte."
msgstr ""
"Public operations validate the face and dispatch `ops(context, ...)`. "
"Providers can use direct private calls within their register hot paths. A "
"missing optional method reports `NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`. Different "
"provider/mode tables coexist without replacing public symbols. IRQ entries "
"are fixed to the selected concrete instances and do not look up a factory "
"for each byte."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:33
msgid ""
"Generated factory getters return existing identities. Lookup, Platform "
"start, request admission, service, recovery and stop remain separate "
"actions. Controller and endpoint identities stay distinct for SPI/I2C buses."
" New products should use the generated strong-reference header; see the "
"[factory contract](/explanation/factory.md) for headers and ID lifetime."
msgstr ""
"Generated factory getters return existing identities. Lookup, Platform "
"start, request admission, service, recovery and stop remain separate "
"actions. Controller and endpoint identities stay distinct for SPI/I2C buses."
" New products should use the generated strong-reference header; see the "
"[factory contract](/explanation/factory.md) for headers and ID lifetime."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:39
msgid ""
"The direct path has one serialized executor in each operation's allowed "
"context. Requests and transfer buffers remain caller-owned through acquire-"
"observed SETTLED. Cancel, deadline and failed drain never revoke a borrow. A"
" provider withdraws hardware, IRQ and deferred references before its final "
"release publication; QUARANTINED storage and cleanup responsibility remain "
"retained. The [ownership table](/explanation/ownership.md) distinguishes "
"direct calls, fixed IRQ work, cross-task adapters, waiting and shutdown."
msgstr ""
"The direct path has one serialized executor in each operation's allowed "
"context. Requests and transfer buffers remain caller-owned through acquire-"
"observed SETTLED. Cancel, deadline and failed drain never revoke a borrow. A"
" provider withdraws hardware, IRQ and deferred references before its final "
"release publication; QUARANTINED storage and cleanup responsibility remain "
"retained. The [ownership table](/explanation/ownership.md) distinguishes "
"direct calls, fixed IRQ work, cross-task adapters, waiting and shutdown."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:47
msgid ""
"`nexus/io/diagnostic.h` composes copied request/stream observations and "
"explicitly known lifecycle, owner admission, service-time and observer-join "
"facts. The result retains independent finding bits and unknown fact groups. "
"An unchanged request does not prove a missed service; a service-gap finding "
"requires explicit timestamps and a declared budget in the same monotonic "
"domain. Neither this helper nor a readable reason key touches live hardware "
"or changes ownership. SETTLED does not prove successful transfer or joined "
"observers. An outstanding stream count includes producer, ready and consumer"
" loans, and a busy ordinary cursor does not describe a private preposted "
"cursor. Unknown facts remain unknown; an empty finding mask does not "
"establish health."
msgstr ""
"`nexus/io/diagnostic.h` composes copied request/stream observations and "
"explicitly known lifecycle, owner admission, service-time and observer-join "
"facts. The result retains independent finding bits and unknown fact groups. "
"An unchanged request does not prove a missed service; a service-gap finding "
"requires explicit timestamps and a declared budget in the same monotonic "
"domain. Neither this helper nor a readable reason key touches live hardware "
"or changes ownership. SETTLED does not prove successful transfer or joined "
"observers. An outstanding stream count includes producer, ready and consumer"
" loans, and a busy ordinary cursor does not describe a private preposted "
"cursor. Unknown facts remain unknown; an empty finding mask does not "
"establish health."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:58
msgid ""
"Stream reserve, publish, acquire, release, abort and stop access a constant "
"amount of metadata independent of block count. Stop checks the outstanding "
"count and does not scan or revoke borrowed blocks under an interrupt mask. "
"Cold storage-overlap validation examines the complete selected block set; it"
" has a different cost. These software complexity contracts do not establish "
"physical IRQ latency."
msgstr ""
"Stream reserve, publish, acquire, release, abort and stop access a constant "
"amount of metadata independent of block count. Stop checks the outstanding "
"count and does not scan or revoke borrowed blocks under an interrupt mask. "
"Cold storage-overlap validation examines the complete selected block set; it"
" has a different cost. These software complexity contracts do not establish "
"physical IRQ latency."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:64
msgid ""
"DMA memory completion, peripheral wire completion and request settlement are"
" separate facts. Providers check exact DMA reachability, selected domains, "
"Cache ownership and real source withdrawal. Finite and continuous modes have"
" distinct loan/rearm/backpressure contracts. Default paths add no mandatory "
"OS locks, hidden driver tasks or universal buffer pools. The [DMA and stream"
" contracts](/design/io-evolution.md) own exact scope."
msgstr ""
"DMA memory completion, peripheral wire completion and request settlement are"
" separate facts. Providers check exact DMA reachability, selected domains, "
"Cache ownership and real source withdrawal. Finite and continuous modes have"
" distinct loan/rearm/backpressure contracts. Default paths add no mandatory "
"OS locks, hidden driver tasks or universal buffer pools. The [DMA and stream"
" contracts](/design/io-evolution.md) own exact scope."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:71
msgid ""
"`nx_dma_storage_validate` checks a caller's explicit whole reservation "
"separately from the transfer payload. For example, an aligned 64-byte "
"reservation may carry a 17-byte payload while exclusively owning two 32-byte"
" cache lines. Address and capacity must already fit the declared alignment, "
"complete DMA-visible domain and optional whole-line geometry; no rounding, "
"allocation or hidden bounce buffer occurs. The caller supplies reviewed "
"geometry and exclusive ownership. The provider still validates the selected "
"mode and actual cache/DMA capabilities and performs necessary maintenance. "
"Cancel or deadline expiry never permits storage reuse before drain and "
"acquire-observed settlement."
msgstr ""
"`nx_dma_storage_validate` checks a caller's explicit whole reservation "
"separately from the transfer payload. For example, an aligned 64-byte "
"reservation may carry a 17-byte payload while exclusively owning two 32-byte"
" cache lines. Address and capacity must already fit the declared alignment, "
"complete DMA-visible domain and optional whole-line geometry; no rounding, "
"allocation or hidden bounce buffer occurs. The caller supplies reviewed "
"geometry and exclusive ownership. The provider still validates the selected "
"mode and actual cache/DMA capabilities and performs necessary maintenance. "
"Cancel or deadline expiry never permits storage reuse before drain and "
"acquire-observed settlement."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:81
msgid ""
"The optional [USB activation contract](/design/usb-device.md) keeps a "
"separate immutable activation face and the existing provider context. Its "
"selected nonzero endpoint setter is a bounded controller action; external "
"Chapter 9 policy owns configuration, rollback and ordinary packet admission."
" It adds no default worker or configuration transaction. The public "
"declaration retains its context, partial-effect and full-stop obligations."
msgstr ""
"The optional [USB activation contract](/design/usb-device.md) keeps a "
"separate immutable activation face and the existing provider context. Its "
"selected nonzero endpoint setter is a bounded controller action; external "
"Chapter 9 policy owns configuration, rollback and ordinary packet admission."
" It adds no default worker or configuration transaction. The public "
"declaration retains its context, partial-effect and full-stop obligations."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/io/README.md:88
msgid ""
"Native, production-register models, selected ARM links and physical HIL "
"establish different evidence. Independent instance state and source-"
"directory organization do not establish electrical behavior, measured timing"
" or losslessness under arbitrary load. MCU physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"Native, production-register models, selected ARM links and physical HIL "
"establish different evidence. Independent instance state and source-"
"directory organization do not establish electrical behavior, measured timing"
" or losslessness under arbitrary load. MCU physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed`."

