#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/boards/README.md:4
msgid ""
"A Board package records PCB/source identity, the exact SoC, oscillators, "
"reviewed controller bindings, safe initial levels, reserved resources, "
"provenance and explicitly unknown electrical facts. It reuses the selected "
"[SoC provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/README.md); it does not copy drivers or vendor SDKs."
msgstr ""
"A Board package records PCB/source identity, the exact SoC, oscillators, "
"reviewed controller bindings, safe initial levels, reserved resources, "
"provenance and explicitly unknown electrical facts. It reuses the selected "
"[SoC provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/README.md); it does not copy drivers or vendor SDKs."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/boards/README.md:15
msgid ""
"Private PCB packages belong in external product repositories and are "
"selected through `board_package`. Maintained public packages are selected "
"through `board`. Keep the family identifier independent of the "
"manufacturer's physical directory. Board declarations cannot change a chip's"
" memory geometry or enable an unmaintained clock profile, DMA route or "
"controller mode."
msgstr ""
"Private PCB packages belong in external product repositories and are "
"selected through `board_package`. Maintained public packages are selected "
"through `board`. Keep the family identifier independent of the "
"manufacturer's physical directory. Board declarations cannot change a chip's"
" memory geometry or enable an unmaintained clock profile, DMA route or "
"controller mode."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/boards/README.md:21
msgid ""
"Start with an exact part and a small reviewed route set, then follow the "
"[Board porting guide](/guides/board-porting.md). A syntactically valid JSON "
"file does not establish fitted components, connector continuity, power "
"supply or physical timing. Uninspected PCB revisions and jumpers remain "
"unknown; software fixtures do not qualify a real PCB. MCU physical HIL "
"remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"Start with an exact part and a small reviewed route set, then follow the "
